<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>DocumentCurrency Licensing | Enterprise</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/style.css">
  <script defer src="assets/app.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="topbar">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="nav">
        <a class="brand" href="index.html">
          <div class="brand-badge"></div>
          <div>
            <div class="brand-title">DocumentCurrency</div>
            <span class="brand-sub">Enterprise Licensing System</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <div class="links">
          <a href="index.html">Licensing</a>
          <a href="enterprise.html">Enterprise</a>
          <a href="terms.html">Terms</a>
          <a href="api/license/tiers.json" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">API</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="h1">Enterprise Licensing</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        A deployable licensing framework for DOC.USD and TransitCloud.
        Issue verifiable license tokens, enforce permissions at runtime, and support enterprise / government deployments.
      </p>
      <div class="btnrow">
        <a class="btn" href="enterprise.html">Enterprise Offering</a>
        <a class="btn secondary" href="terms.html">Read Terms</a>
        <button class="btn secondary" onclick="openTiers()">View Tiers JSON</button>
      </div>
      <div class="pillrow">
        <div class="pill">License Tokens</div>
        <div class="pill">Permission Flags</div>
        <div class="pill">SLA + Support</div>
        <div class="pill">On-Prem / Private Cloud</div>
        <div class="pill">Registry + Issuance Controls</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="h2">License Tiers</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card third">
          <div class="kv">
            <div class="k">Developer</div>
            <div class="v">Build and test integrations. No production issuance.</div>
          </div>
          <hr class="sep">
          <div class="small">Includes: docs, sandbox tools, read-only verification APIs.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="card third">
          <div class="kv">
            <div class="k">Commercial</div>
            <div class="v">Production issuance for SaaS/fintech. Usage-based pricing.</div>
          </div>
          <hr class="sep">
          <div class="small">Includes: issuance permission, integration support, registry access.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="card third">
          <div class="kv">
            <div class="k">Enterprise / Government</div>
            <div class="v">Run private nodes, HSM signing, custom compliance + SLA.</div>
          </div>
          <hr class="sep">
          <div class="small">Includes: on-prem deployment, audits, incident response, legal support.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr class="sep">

      <h2 class="h2">How Enforcement Works</h2>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="code">TransitCloud Issuance Request
  → verify license token (tier, expiry, signature)
  → check permission flags (issue_documents, registry_write, run_node)
  → allow or deny operation
  → emit receipt + audit event</div>
        <p class="small">
          GitHub Pages hosts the licensing UI and static tier metadata. For cryptographic verification, deploy the serverless verify endpoint.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="h2">License Verify (Static Mode)</h2>
      <div class="notice small">
        <strong>Note:</strong> This verification runs in the browser only and checks structure, not signatures.
        Deploy <code>api/license/verify.example.js</code> to enable cryptographic verification.
      </div>

      <div class="grid" style="margin-top:14px;">
        <div class="card half">
          <label for="license_json">Paste License JSON</label>
          <textarea id="license_json" rows="12" placeholder='{"license_id":"DOCUSD-LIC-000124", "...":"..."}'></textarea>
          <div class="btnrow">
            <button class="btn" onclick="verifyLicenseStatic()">Verify (Static)</button>
            <button class="btn secondary" onclick="loadSample()">Load Sample</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card half">
          <div class="kv">
            <div class="k">Result</div>
            <div class="v">
              <pre id="verify_out" class="code">—</pre>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="small">
            Production: route verification through a serverless API that validates Ed25519 signatures and checks revocation/expiry.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <div class="container">
      Author of Record: Kam Swygert • Powered by TransitCloud • DOC.USD Licensing System
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
